guava.sorted.txt and slf4j-api.sorted.txt hold the version strings (public
data) of com.google.guava:guava and org.slf4j:slf4j-api, as listed in their
maven-metadata.xml on Maven Central on 2026-11-25, sorted in ascending order
by org.apache.maven.artifact.versioning.ComparableVersion from maven-artifact
3.9.11 (its ComparableVersion.java is identical to 3.9.16, the release the
scheme ports), with ties broken by String.compareTo:

    vs.sort(Comparator.comparing((String s) -> new ComparableVersion(s))
            .thenComparing(Comparator.naturalOrder()));

The ordering vectors in maven_test.go come from Maven's
maven-artifact/src/test/java/org/apache/maven/artifact/versioning/ComparableVersionTest.java
